00:43:53.741 --> 00:43:55.469 line:77%
No miento. Un 10, sí. Y tanto.

00:43:55.750 --> 00:43:56.470 line:77%
(RÍEN)

00:43:58.242 --> 00:44:00.513 line:75%
-Yo creo que lo sabía
bastante gente.

00:44:03.896 --> 00:44:05.720 line:77%
<c.yellow>¿Sí?</c>

00:44:05.721 --> 00:44:07.385 line:75%
